cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, its framework or its template, please cite it as below."
title: "From Code Repository to Research Infrastructure: Evaluating GitHub for Managing the Scientific Research Lifecycle"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid bibliometric and coverage-analysis study of the literature on digital
  infrastructure for research-process management, a literature-derived research
  management requirements framework (RM1-RM15), a reproducible assessment of how far
  GitHub's native functionalities cover those requirements, a reference architecture,
  and a reusable GitHub research-project template evaluated self-referentially.
